<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON LATEST -  HENMAN OUT, SAMPRAS LEADS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON LATEST -  HENMAN OUT, SAMPRAS LEADS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest scores in the men's singles</p>
<p>quarter-finals at Wimbledon on Thursday (prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>(Rain stopped play at 1240 GMT, resumed 1520GMT)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v 8-Boris Becker (Germany)</p>
<p>Sampras leads 6-1 6-7(5-7) 5-1 third set</p>
<p>Played earlier:</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 6-4 4-6</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Nicolas Kiefer (Germany)</p>
<p>7-6(9-7) 2-6 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat 14-Tim Henman (Britain) 6-3 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
